        323.3242010732324,
        290.52479411764705,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "PRESIDENTIAL DECREE NO. 1067",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.29044485294118,
        368.69643434343436,
        940.4351552287583,
        17.434900568181888
      ],
      "text": "A DECREE INSTITUTING A WATER CODE, THEREBY REVISING AND CONSOLIDATING THE LAWS GOVERNING",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        57.7518345996732,
        395.4735369318182,
        909.4997323937909,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "THE OWNERSHIP, APPROPRIATION, UTILIZATION, EXPLOITATION, DEVELOPMENT, CONSERVATION AND",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        349.15167892156865,
        422.2506136363637,
        326.6810829248366,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "PROTECTION OF WATER RESOURCES",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        467.6230410353536,
        941.4147152369281,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "WHEREAS, Article XIV, Section 8 of the New Constitution of the Philippines provides, inter alia, that all waters",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        494.400117739899,
        318.3220555147059,
        17.434900568181888
      ],
      "text": "of the Philippines belong to the State;",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        539.7724286616162,
        941.406743014706,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "WHEREAS, existing water legislations are piece-meal and inadequate to cope with increasing scarcity of water",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        566.54953125,
        306.0897189133987,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "and changing patterns of water use;",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        611.9218033459597,
        941.4011155637256,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "WHEREAS, there is a need for a Water Code based on rational concepts of integrated and multipurpose",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        638.6989188762627,
        831.8215812500001,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "management of water resources and su=ciently Xexible to adequately meet future developments;",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        684.0713462752526,
        941.4009145833335,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "WHEREAS, water is vital to national development and it has become increasingly necessary for government to",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        710.848422979798,
        576.7083095996733,
        17.434874684343413
      ],
      "text": "intervene actively in improving the management of water resources;",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        756.2208503787879,
        941.3975314133987,
        17.43487468434347
      ],
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, I, FERDINAND E. MARCOS, President of the Philippines, by virtue of the powers in me",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        782.9979400252525,
        941.4148157271242,
        17.43487468434344
      ],
      "text": "vested by the Constitution, do hereby order and decree the enactment of the Water Code of the Philippines of",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        809.7750296717172,
        143.98988803104575,
        17.43487468434344
      ],
      "text": "1976, as follows:",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        463.89877083333334,
        855.1473276515152,
        97.18554248366019,
        17.434874684343413
      ],
      "text": "CHAPTER I",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        339.72638521241834,
        900.5196541035353,
        345.5341323529411,
        17.4348798611111
      ],
      "text": "Declaration of Objectives and Principles",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/CQVXGY+Roboto-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        945.8920258522727,
        642.4715056781047,
        17.43488374368686
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 1. This Code shall be known as The Water Code of the Philippines.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
